{
  "message": "有没有推荐的學習资源？"
}

### 6. 获取会话信息
GET http://localhost:8008/agent/session/session003

### 7. 复杂任务处理 - 代码分析
POST http://localhost:8008/agent/task
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task": "请帮我分析以下代码的问题并提出改进建议：\n\npublic class UserService {\n    public User getUser(Long id) {\n        Connection conn = DriverManager.getConnection(\"url\", \"user\", \"pass\");\n        Statement stmt = conn.createStatement();\n        ResultSet rs = stmt.executeQuery(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = \" + id);\n        if (rs.next()) {\n            User user = new User();\n            user.setId(rs.getLong(\"id\"));\n            user.setName(rs.getString(\"name\"));\n            return user;\n        }\n        return null;\n    }\n}"
}

### 8. 复杂任务处理 - 算法问题
POST http://localhost:8008/agent/task
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task": "请解释快速排序算法的原理，并提供 Java 实现"
}

### 9. 清除会话历史
DELETE http://localhost:8008/agent/session/session003
